    "physical_description": "Modern zinme (Chiangmai) design. Yellow, white, green, blue and lilac honeycomb weft patterns on a plain pink warp ground.\r\nThere is a vertically striped area, consisting of pin stripes and closely patterned linear designs which forms the inside pleat of the longyi.\r\nThe warp ends of the rectangle are drawn together and seamed to form a tube. The spare material is lapped over to the left and tucked in at the waist forming a pleat.",
